    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰάσσω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάσσω</span>, used only in
			pres. and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sit</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπὼν ἕδος ἔνθα θάασσεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.194
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.124
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ ἔοικε . . ἐν δαιτὶ θαασσέμεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					3.336
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				172
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετ᾽ ἀθανάτοισι θαάσσεις</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				468
			</span></i>.</div>
